{"question": "kg-decision-llm", "strategy": "hybrid", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "effort": null, "answer": {"answer": "No. Per the accepted decision decision:no-embedded-llm (RF-24, 'No LLM inside kg'), kg never calls an LLM and needs no API keys. External agents (e.g. Claude Code, recorded as extractor 'claude-code' with method 'llm') read the documents and decisions themselves and send kg JSON documents. These enter the graph through `kg add` (kg.merge.add_to_store), which validates the JSON against the schema and merges it into the .kg store by ID. kg helps those agents with `kg guide` (kg.agents / kg.cli._guide), the guidelines for external agents that enrich the graph (RF-20), which is also exported as a skill. When merging, parser provenance wins over llm/manual provenance (decision:parser-wins-over-llm), so agent enrichment cannot overwrite deterministic extracted data.", "items": [], "evidence": ["decision:no-embedded-llm", "decision:no-embedded-llm -[justifies]-> package:kg", "docs/requirements.md:144", "function:kg.merge.add_to_store", "src/kg/merge.py:113-123", "package:kg.agents", "function:kg.cli._guide", "src/kg/cli.py:89-94", "function:kg.agents.load_guide", "decision:parser-wins-over-llm", "decision:parser-wins-over-llm -[justifies]-> module:kg.merge"]}, "outcome": "answered", "turns": 16, "tool_calls": 15, "tool_errors": 1, "context_chars": 18389, "seconds": 70.79, "usage": {"total_tokens": 38597}, "repo": "kg", "topic": "decisions", "grade": {"score": 1.0, "precision": null, "recall": null, "missing": [], "extra": []}, "traceability": 1.0, "calls": ["kg", "kg", "kg", "read_file", "kg", "kg", "read_file", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "kg", "read_file", "kg", "read_file", "submit_answer"], "config": {"runner": "subagent", "max_turns": 25, "strategies": ["hybrid"], "questions": "bench/questions/main.json", "repos": {"basic-python-cli": "d0379bb", "kg": "1a342c4", "kg-stale": "1a342c4", "my_first_data_project": "3d57177", "python-clean-architecture": "6f58